<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine to boost Cheung Kong warrants.</title>
<headline>Peregrine to boost Cheung Kong warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Wednesday it intended to increase the issue size of its call warrants on shares of Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd by 30 million warrants to a total 100 million warrants.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$60.75	PREMIUM	 7.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.35	 GEARING	 5.1X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  30.OCT.97     MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG     SPOT PRICE    HK$69.00</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
